# Source-only repository. New files stay private unless explicitly allowed here.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!CastleCTF.uproject

!Source/
!Source/**/
!Source/**/*.cpp
!Source/**/*.h
!Source/**/*.cs

!Config/
!Config/DefaultEngine.ini
!Config/DefaultGame.ini
!Config/DefaultInput.ini
!Config/DefaultEditor.ini

# README previews and the source texture needed to rebuild the characters.
!docs/
!docs/images/
!docs/images/gameplay.png
!docs/images/characters.png
!docs/images/character-faces.png

!Tools/
!Tools/CharacterPipeline/
!Tools/CharacterPipeline/README.md
!Tools/CharacterPipeline/scripts/
!Tools/CharacterPipeline/scripts/build_brimbound_lowpoly.py
!Tools/CharacterPipeline/scripts/export_lowpoly.py
!Tools/CharacterPipeline/scripts/roundtrip_lowpoly.py
!Tools/CharacterPipeline/scripts/finalize_lowpoly.py
!Tools/CharacterPipeline/textures/
!Tools/CharacterPipeline/textures/Anime_Expressions.png
!Tools/CharacterPipeline/textures/face_generation_prompts.json

# Never publish credentials, even beneath an allowed directory.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.ssh/
**/.aws/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/credentials*
**/secrets.*
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/id_github*

# Content, SourceAssets, Saved, Intermediate, Binaries, DerivedDataCache,
# generated Blender/FBX output, archives, logs, IDE state and local settings are omitted.
